Śūrpaṇakhā sees fourteen thousand slain and roars --- Śūrpaṇakhā flees agitated to Rāvaṇa-guarded Laṅkā --- Rāvaṇa sits golden enthroned among ministers like Indra --- Scarred twenty-armed Rāvaṇa awes gods and sages --- Rāvaṇa churned oceans crushed gods and stole Puṣpaka --- Rāvaṇa claims safety from all beings save men --- Rāvaṇa steals offerings kills brahmins and harms creatures --- Disfigured Śūrpaṇakhā addresses wide-eyed brother with dread news